        dat("THE WRITE witnesses_inquiry_commanded — a STATUS on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DJ2 — the third seat's own status; condemned_city_inquiry_required and idolater_inquiry_required the tape's references); THE PARAMETER the_inquiry_well (the seven at three verses); the exam's person the witness who says 'I do not know' at an interrogation — accepted against, the testimony void")
