        return out("as he plotted (19:19) — refuted in their persons, not in their testimony; killed by the second set's mouth; as he plotted, not as he did (the Sifrei 190:8-12; Mishnah Makkot 1:4; courts_prophet's %s by CALL): THE WRITE plotting_witness_talion_commanded, a STATUS on Israel at the chapters' own day; the plotting witness refuted in his person put to death" % (CP_HAND[1][0],), ['plotting_witness_talion_commanded', 'put_to_death'])
