        dat("the formula's seat a DATA row — israel_hears_and_fears the tape's reference, NEVER A SECOND WRITE (DJ4); evil_purged_from_the_midst the plotters' body effect; the exam's person the plotting witness executed in the sight of the rest — the evil purged from the midst (the body effect reused, never a line's write)")
        return out("the rest hear and fear (19:20) — the formula's third seat of four; the purge formula's fourth of nine (the Sifrei 190:13; seducers' %s by CALL): israel_hears_and_fears the tape's reference, no second write; the executed plotter's evil purged from the midst" % (SE_NINE[:24],), ['evil_purged_from_the_midst'])
